---
title: "Climbing"
---

### **The favourite discipline of young people**

We love the classic mountain routes, rich in history and charm, which keep the explorer's spirit of those who first climbed them. We climb to test ourselves and to live intense emotions to share with our rope partners.

The ideal settings for our adventures are the Presolana, the "queen" of our mountains, and the Grigne, but our eyes and hearts are always turned to the Dolomites, the temples of classic climbing.

For generations we have learned the rules of climbing from the more experienced GAP members, until we can lead a mountain climb on our own.

##### **Activities:**

For beginner members and young people, we organise free days at indoor gyms and on rock walls equipped for sport climbing.
